{"author":{"id":"e8ccbc170af88335916e23a1b24e48c04b0a4af82e988d5245cc91e39d6a9e2c"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1794498290,"nonce":"+OttJ84IKJ03L3cRxjoPWB/J4Xg=","message":"Landed on `roadmap-190c308-integration` (cf5365a..065801e).\n\n**Changes**\n- src/ui/results.rs: new. Results card (excluded banner, verdict with stale badge and Re-run, stats table, canvas bars, collapsible debate), `finish_run` history save, 15 unit tests\n- src/ui/mod.rs: `debate_open`, `ToggleDebate`, `Rerun`, `HistorySaved`, `ScrollSnapshot` messages; `view` uses `results_card`; page scrollable id\n- src/ui/input.rs: `on_pipeline` returns `Task` (a finished run saves history); `running`, `Tone` and `chip_style` made `pub(super)`\n- src/i18n.rs: 13 new ES/EN keys\n- src/domain/stats.rs: `units_agree` made `pub(crate)` so bars skip rows with mismatched units\n- src/ui/snap.rs: `MAEVE_SCROLL` and `MAEVE_DEBATE` env vars\n- scripts/snap.sh: also writes `-mid` and `-end` PNGs for the compare screen\n\n**Gates:** fmt ok · clippy ok · test ok (179 passed, 1 ignored keychain test)\n**Review:** 1 findings — 1 auto, 0 by hand, 0 deferred\n\n**Decisions**\n- Bold needs `Font::with_name(\"Helvetica Neue\")`. `Font::DEFAULT` at Bold or Semibold fell back to monospace or the wrong face on macOS. The comment in `bold()` says macOS is the only target.\n- Bar chart: one canvas bar per product, with text labels in widgets beside it. This avoids clipped text, and the bar width stays proportional to the value. Lower-is-better rows get a \"(menor es mejor)\" label, taken from `judge.rows[].better` or the row kind. Rows with a missing number, mismatched units or all zeros get no bars.\n- Chart series colours come from the chart-1..5 tokens. The 2nd series is pale in light mode and dim in dark mode, so each bar has a 1px outline in `muted_foreground` at 0.6 alpha to stay readable.\n- `Rerun` calls `compare()` when a result exists. Ready products are reused (`ItemInput.product = Some`) and failed items are re-scraped.\n- `finish_run` fills the stored `CompareInput` with products scraped during the run, then saves a `ComparisonRecord` through `Store::save_comparison`. A history restore can then re-run without scraping.\n- Total-row cells with unknown shipping show a small \"Envío a confirmar\" line.\n- The Total, Rating and Reviews row labels are localised in the UI. `stats.rs` hard-codes them in English.\n- Review fix: `f32::clamp(3.0, width)` panics when the canvas width collapses below 3, so it was replaced with `max(3.0).min(width)` and non-negative sizes.\n- I looked at the PNGs in all 4 theme/language combos (top, mid, end with debate open), plus a temporary stale+excluded run that I reverted. Table aligned, bars not clipped, dark-mode contrast readable. The 4 combos are not covered by tests.","files":null}]}